    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/9521ed62a03c993512ca34b207178d6e.poster.avif?t=1746466157\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/9521ed62a03c993512ca34b207178d6e.webm?t=1746466157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Malevolent Madness</i> invites players into a tension-filled horror adventure, offering an experience rich in mystery and puzzles. A mysterious time machine unleashes extraordinary powers that could disrupt the balance between universes, but this discovery becomes a significant threat to humanity in the wrong hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players guide a scientist with special abilities assigned to secret projects. Hidden in a dark cave, a time machine, which can only be activated by a specific DNA, initially shows no response but suddenly starts to function unexpectedly. This machine poses a risk of annihilating the universes if the same matter exists in both. As our character uncovers the terrifying secrets behind the machine, they decide to quit their job, yet a malevolent professor wishes to use the machine for his own purposes and abducts the character, subjecting them to torturous tests. The horrifying events grow increasingly complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Tension and Mystery</strong>: Explore in a dark atmosphere filled with lurking dangers at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Artificial Intelligence</strong>: Face enemies and cleverly designed puzzles that force you to hide and escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Visual and Audio Design</strong>: Experience fear deeply with top-notch graphics and quality sound design at every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour and Stealth Mechanics</strong>: Utilize your skills to progress and remain alert at all times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/fa38d44da08e97e25773d8af568709a3.poster.avif?t=1746466157\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/fa38d44da08e97e25773d8af568709a3.webm?t=1746466157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/9521ed62a03c993512ca34b207178d6e.poster.avif?t=1746466157\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/9521ed62a03c993512ca34b207178d6e.webm?t=1746466157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>About</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Malevolent Madness</i> invites players into a tension-filled horror adventure, offering an experience rich in mystery and puzzles. A mysterious time machine unleashes extraordinary powers that could disrupt the balance between universes, but this discovery becomes a significant threat to humanity in the wrong hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players guide a scientist with special abilities assigned to secret projects. Hidden in a dark cave, a time machine, which can only be activated by a specific DNA, initially shows no response but suddenly starts to function unexpectedly. This machine poses a risk of annihilating the universes if the same matter exists in both. As our character uncovers the terrifying secrets behind the machine, they decide to quit their job, yet a malevolent professor wishes to use the machine for his own purposes and abducts the character, subjecting them to torturous tests. The horrifying events grow increasingly complex.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense Tension and Mystery</strong>: Explore in a dark atmosphere filled with lurking dangers at every turn.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Artificial Intelligence</strong>: Face enemies and cleverly designed puzzles that force you to hide and escape.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Visual and Audio Design</strong>: Experience fear deeply with top-notch graphics and quality sound design at every step.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parkour and Stealth Mechanics</strong>: Utilize your skills to progress and remain alert at all times!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/fa38d44da08e97e25773d8af568709a3.poster.avif?t=1746466157\" width=600 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3290550/extras/fa38d44da08e97e25773d8af568709a3.webm?t=1746466157\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
